                <invention-title lang="de">KAMERAMODUL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">MODULE DE CAMÉRA</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CAMERA MODULE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A camera module comprises: a first body including an upper plate and a side plate extending from the upper plate; a second body coupled to the first body; a lens module, at least a portion of which is placed inside the first body; a first shield cover coupled to the first body; and a substrate assembly placed inside the second body, wherein at least a portion of the first shield cover is placed at a higher position than the upper plate of the first body and revealed to the outside.</p>
